# The flagship `gallery` example: every widget composed into one Elm-loop
# app, run as its scripted snapshot tour. Produces the hero GIF.
Output docs/widgets/media/gallery.gif
Source vhs/common.tape
Set FontSize 13
Set Width 1200
Set Height 760

Hide
Type "target/debug/examples/gallery"
Enter
Sleep 1500ms
Show
Sleep 6s
